  <NMM_EmbarrassedByCumpilation.stages.seen_covered_in_cum.label>被人看到满身精液</NMM_EmbarrassedByCumpilation.stages.seen_covered_in_cum.label>
  <NMM_EmbarrassedByCumpilation.stages.seen_covered_in_cum.description>他们看到我身上到处是精液。我觉得又脏又难堪。</NMM_EmbarrassedByCumpilation.stages.seen_covered_in_cum.description>
  <NMM_EmbarrassedByExposure.stages.exposed_and_embarrassed.label>走光难堪</NMM_EmbarrassedByExposure.stages.exposed_and_embarrassed.label>
  <NMM_EmbarrassedByExposure.stages.exposed_and_embarrassed.description>我还没来得及遮住，就被人看到了裸体。</NMM_EmbarrassedByExposure.stages.exposed_and_embarrassed.description>
  <NMM_EnjoyedTheView.stages.enjoyed_the_view.label>大饱眼福</NMM_EnjoyedTheView.stages.enjoyed_the_view.label>
  <NMM_EnjoyedTheirAttention.stages.enjoyed_their_attention.label>享受他们的关注</NMM_EnjoyedTheirAttention.stages.enjoyed_their_attention.label>
  <NMM_ExhibitionistCumpilationCoverage.stages.enjoyed_being_noticed.label>被注意到很享受</NMM_ExhibitionistCumpilationCoverage.stages.enjoyed_being_noticed.label>
  <NMM_ExhibitionistCumpilationCoverage.stages.enjoyed_being_noticed.description>被人看到我身上沾满体液，让我暗自兴奋。</NMM_ExhibitionistCumpilationCoverage.stages.enjoyed_being_noticed.description>
  <NMM_ExhibitionistPleased_Variant1.stages.enjoyed_the_attention.label>享受被围观</NMM_ExhibitionistPleased_Variant1.stages.enjoyed_the_attention.label>
  <NMM_ExhibitionistPleased_Variant1.stages.enjoyed_the_attention.description>赤裸着被人盯着的感觉太棒了。我想要更多目光落在我身上。</NMM_ExhibitionistPleased_Variant1.stages.enjoyed_the_attention.description>
  <NMM_FlauntedThemselves.stages.flaunted_themselves.label>故意炫耀身材</NMM_FlauntedThemselves.stages.flaunted_themselves.label>
  <NMM_JealousyConsumed_Variant1.stages.consumed_by_jealousy.label>被嫉妒吞噬</NMM_JealousyConsumed_Variant1.stages.consumed_by_jealousy.label>
  <NMM_JealousyConsumed_Variant1.stages.consumed_by_jealousy.description>别人盯着我伴侣裸体看的画面挥之不去。我满脑子都是这件事。</NMM_JealousyConsumed_Variant1.stages.consumed_by_jealousy.description>
  <NMM_LookedDownOnEnvious.stages.caught_them_being_envious.label>抓到他们在嫉妒</NMM_LookedDownOnEnvious.stages.caught_them_being_envious.label>
  <NMM_OglingMyPartner.stages.looked_at_my_partner.label>盯着我的伴侣看</NMM_OglingMyPartner.stages.looked_at_my_partner.label>
  <NMM_PrudeSawCumpilationCoverage.stages.uncomfortable_messy_sight.label>脏乱景象让人不适</NMM_PrudeSawCumpilationCoverage.stages.uncomfortable_messy_sight.label>
  <NMM_PrudeSawCumpilationCoverage.stages.uncomfortable_messy_sight.description>看到有人身上明显沾满体液，令人作呕。</NMM_PrudeSawCumpilationCoverage.stages.uncomfortable_messy_sight.description>
  <NMM_ResentsComparison.stages.made_me_feel_inferior.label>让我自愧不如</NMM_ResentsComparison.stages.made_me_feel_inferior.label>
